/**

@defgroup safe_data_apis Safe Data API
@brief CRC-protected (optionally redundant) data containers with integrity guaranteed by construction.
@details A safe container bundles a user payload with an integrity tag (CRC),
         an optional inverted shadow copy, and a per-container mutex. All
         access goes through operations that hold the lock across the whole
         read-modify-write and reseal the tag automatically, so a stale tag or
         a torn update cannot happen by construction.
@since 0.1
@version 0.2
@{
@}

*/
